# series aeneas: patch -p1 in the root of the upstream source
#
# Model specialization schemas, local native primitives, start-from roots
#
# - Specialized trait decls (e.g. FnOnce<(&mut T,)> from --monomorphize-mut)
#   match builtin models whose pattern instantiates the trait's generics.
# - A local type with an opaque model loses its Rust fields; items nested in a
#   modeled function (closures, their impls) are not translation roots.
# - Translation roots are Charon's --start-from items (all local items when
#   none were given), so shell-only dependencies of replaced bodies are pruned.
# - Unit outputs are elided only when the callee declares them (not at a unit
#   instantiation of a generic output or trait Output).
# - A modeled trait's associated types absent from its record are ignored.
# - resolve_modeled_defaults tolerates trait methods Charon did not declare.

